Competition data notice
-----------------------

This repository does NOT contain the competition dataset. The original
competition data (train.csv, test.csv, sample_submission.csv) is provided
separately by the competition platform and is subject to the competition's
own terms of use. The competition data page lists the dataset license as
MIT. Reproduction of the canonical submission requires that data to be
supplied by the user in a `competition_data/` directory adjacent to the
reproduction script.

The code, notebooks, reports, and submission file in this repository are
distributed under the MIT License above.